            "reason_code": "live_evidence_not_ratified",
            "follow_up": "Ratify and run the independent connector evidence contract (25.6 live probe) against a test Piano site with real custom Data Model keys -- including the dynamic-catalog unknown-column drift path and the Data Model admin-endpoint spike (ROLLOUT_NOTES)."
