    "account_topology": {
        "_comment": "Story 28.1 (pattern 25.5): Piano reporting topology is organization -> site. The selected reporting entity is the SITE (space.s=[<site_id>]). There is NO documented public endpoint that enumerates the sites an API key can reach: v1 discovery verifies candidate site ids via a 1-day getData access-check probe (unreachable candidates dropped). PIANO_*_SITE_ID account fallbacks are FORBIDDEN in the pull path (doctrine); selection/access-check/trial/backfill are the core topology flows.",
